          "description": "Per agent ROLE (name before the colon, so \"Deviation check: TP-1\" and \"Deviation check: TP-2\" are one role). A session is one worker, or one main-session run. Highest = most expensive single session; average and median are over the same sessions. Sessions come from the pushed cost metrics (automatic at run end).",
